WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:07.974
It seems that there's

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:08.875
praise all round

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:09.609
in North Korea

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:10.477
after its latest

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:12.012
test of an intercontinental

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.213
ballistic missile.

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:14.614
State media reports leader Kim

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:16.182
Jong un personally guided the launch

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:16.883
of the one

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.485
song 18 Intercontinental

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:20.186
Ballistic Missile on Wednesday,

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.955
which flew for 74 minutes

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:24.090
before crashing down in the waters

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.291
near Japan.

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:26.493
The longest flight ever

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.528
carried out by this ICBM.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.063
It was a solid fuel missile.

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:30.830
It's been called the north

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.632
most powerful nuclear weapon,

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:33.566
but it's unclear

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:34.768
if it could actually deliver

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:36.436
a nuclear payload.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:38.671
A menacing milestone for North Korea's

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:39.806
missile program.

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:42.308
Pyongyang's latest ICBM launch

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.944
breaking its own record for the longest

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:46.413
ever missile flight.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:49.416
A staggering 74 minutes hurtling

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:51.418
high above the earth at supersonic

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:52.585
speed, hitting

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.220
6000 kilometers

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.256
before splashing down in the sea.

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:57.624
The massive missiles

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:59.192
potential striking range,

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:01.361
the entire US mainland

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:02.896
and most of the world.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.397
Pyongyang's most provocative

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:05.899
launch in months,

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:07.467
coinciding with this NATO's

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:08.902
summit in Lithuania,

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:10.703
quickly condemned by Japan

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:12.972
as an unacceptable threat

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:14.474
to regional stability.

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:15.108
South Korea's

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:17.911
military ready to overwhelmingly respond.

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:19.245
The ICBM,

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:21.481
a crown jewel in leader Kim Jong un's

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:22.615
nuclear arsenal,

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:24.150
protecting the power, fortune

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.419
and future of the ruling Kim family.

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:27.487
His young daughter,

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:28.621
Kim Jae, often

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:30.657
appearing alongside her dad,

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:32.158
barely ten years old.

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:32.859
The rising

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:35.361
star of a state propaganda campaign

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:37.464
carefully crafted by Kim's

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:38.465
younger sister,

00:01:38.465 --> 00:01:40.967
the mastermind of the Kim family brand.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.036
The leader's loyal confidant,

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:44.370
trusted adviser

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.639
and perhaps the most powerful woman

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:47.907
in North Korea.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:50.110
She is the number two war,

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.344
that is for sure.

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:51.878
But actually,

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:55.048
she is very smart lady, and she after the

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:58.485
war, knows that her position is secure

00:01:58.485 --> 00:02:01.421
only when her brother is secure.

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:03.223
Just five years ago,

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:05.692
very few people knew of Kim Yo Jong.

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.027
She stepped on the South Korean soil,

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:09.496
the first member of North

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:12.098
Korea's ruling family to cross the DMZ.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:14.067
She carried a message of peace

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:15.435
from Pyongyang,

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:17.704
North Korean athletes and cheer squads.

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:18.404
Got a warm

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.540
welcome at the 2018 Winter Olympics.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.742
She rose to fame as a fixture

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.077
at her brother's side.

00:02:24.077 --> 00:02:25.411
Standing silently behind

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:26.613
Kim as he met with former

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:27.580
President Trump.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.449
That brief period of diplomacy

00:02:29.449 --> 00:02:31.518
feels like a distant memory.

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:33.153
The silent sister now

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:35.188
allowed voice of defiance,

00:02:35.188 --> 00:02:37.590
issuing fiery statements on state media,

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:40.126
often laced with crude language.

00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:40.760
This week,

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.762
she threatened to shoot down U.S.

00:02:42.896 --> 00:02:44.130
spy planes

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.732
accusing them without evidence

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:47.700
of entering North Korean territory.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.669
Warning in case of repeated

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:51.571
illegal intrusions, the U.S.

00:02:51.571 --> 00:02:53.006
forces will experience

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:55.108
a very critical flight.

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:57.677
Past actions prove she's not all talk.

00:02:58.011 --> 00:02:58.711
In 2020

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:00.180
a dispute with South Korea

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.814
ended with a bang.

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:03.283
Kim ordered the demolition

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:05.418
of a joint liaison office at the border,

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:07.720
turning diplomatic dreams

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.189
into a pile of rubble.

